"For models with a published drafter (Gemma 4 26B) or their own MTP head (our Qwen 3.5 models, downloaded with them): it guesses tokens ahead and the main model checks them in one pass. Same output, faster. Requests are then served one at a time." = "Untuk model dengan drafter yang dipublikasikan (Gemma 4 26B) atau kepala MTP sendiri (model Qwen 3.5 kami, diunduh bersamanya): menebak token di depan dan model utama memeriksanya dalam satu langkah. Hasil sama, lebih cepat. Permintaan lalu dilayani satu per satu.";
