"Full duplex: talk any time, the model hears you while it speaks -- needs a Mac that runs it in real time. Walkie-talkie: talk, press Done, then listen. Automatic picks by this Mac's measured speed." = "Duplex penuh: bicara kapan saja, model mendengar saat berbicara — memerlukan Mac yang mampu menjalankan secara waktu nyata. Walkie‑talkie: bicara, tekan Selesai, lalu dengarkan. Otomatis memilih berdasarkan kecepatan terukur Mac ini.";
"GPTQ 3-bit + 8-bit speech: IPSupport's fastest build -- a 3-bit language model with 8-bit speech recognition and voice, every test answer right. GPTQ 3-bit: the same with the speech parts in full precision. 4-bit: mlx-community's build. Each is downloaded only when you ask." = "GPTQ 3-bit + 8-bit speech: build tercepat dari IPSupport — model bahasa 3-bit dengan pengenalan suara dan keluaran suara 8-bit, setiap jawaban uji benar. GPTQ 3-bit: sama, tetapi bagian suara dalam presisi penuh. 4-bit: build dari mlx-community. Masing‑masing hanya diunduh saat Anda memintanya.";
